+ * Feed format v6, little-endian: "SPCF", u32 version, then records of
  * u8 kind, u32 payload length, payload.
  *  - kind 1 template: u32 index, u16 name length, UTF-8 name, f32 minimap
  *    icon size, u8 flags, then the icon file name relative to
  *    art/textures/ui/session/icons/minimap/ (empty: no icon). Flag 1: the
  *    minimap colour is the owner's player colour.
  *  - kind 2 turn: u32 turn, u32 count, count x {u32 id, u32 template,
- *    i32 x, i32 z, i32 angle, i32 owner, u8 r, u8 g, u8 b, u8 flags},
- *    x/z/angle as raw 16.16 fixed. Flag 1: r/g/b is the minimap colour.
+ *    i32 x, i32 z, i32 angle, i32 owner, u8 r, u8 g, u8 b, u8 flags,
+ *    i32 y, u32 actor, u32 seed, u32 variant set, u32 animation,
+ *    i32 animation speed, i32 sync repeat, i32 sync offset,
+ *    i32 construction progress}. x/y/z/angle/speed/progress are raw 16.16
+ *    fixed, sync repeat and offset raw 16.16 milliseconds. actor and
+ *    animation are strings, 0xFFFFFFFF for none, as is an empty variant
+ *    set. Flag 1: r/g/b is the minimap colour. Flag 2: the entity has a
+ *    VisualActor; without it the visual fields are zero or none. Flag 4: the
+ *    animation plays once. Local entities are left out, except the
+ *    construction previews of foundations ("construction|" templates).
+ *  - kind 6 string, before the turn record that first uses it: u32 index,
+ *    then UTF-8 text. Indices count up from 0.
+ *  - kind 7 variant set, likewise: u32 index, u32 count, count x {u32 key
+ *    string, u32 value string}, sorted by key. The "animation" key is left
+ *    out, as it always holds the animation name, and so are keys whose
+ *    selection is empty.
  *  - kind 3 map: u32 map size in metres, f32 game speed (the sim rate
  *    set up for the match), once before the first turn.
  *  - kind 4 terrain, right after the map record: u32 tiles per side n,
